    "name": "ordersdb_get_table_data",
    "title": "ordersdb: Get Table Data",
    "description": "[ordersdb] Read rows with filter/order/limit/offset. Max 1000 rows per call; paginate for more. count_only=true to count. For SUM/COUNT/AVG/MIN/MAX/GROUP BY use aggregate_data — this tool cannot aggregate.",
